Package: com.nightvibes33.gif2ani
Name: Gif2Ani Rootless
Version: 3.1.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
Conflicts: com.nightvibes33.darkboot, com.wizage.gif2ani2, com.wizages.gif2ani
Replaces: com.nightvibes33.darkboot
Description: Crash-safe custom GIF animations for the BackBoard respring screen on rootless iOS 15 and 16. Selection is inert and processed off the Settings main thread; Apply uses bounded ImageIO decoding and attaches the animation only after BackBoard prepares a valid content layer, with automatic quarantine on failure.
Maintainer: NightVibes33
Author: wizages, rootless port by NightVibes33
Section: Tweaks
